{
  "$comment": "The laundry (crates/art/wet/src/laundry, built by cargo art). Listed in the base manifest's packs. The materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. The washer and the dryer open their door (`door_open`) while a resident loads or empties them, and turn their drum (`drum_spin`) while they run on their own (`running`). The vacuum cleaner, the mop, the broom and the iron leave their place (`*_off`) while a resident has them in hand. The basket of washing and the piece held up to fold are carried (content `items`).",
